+/*
+ * Stained Glass OS: programs pinned to the taskbar
+ *
+ * Where Windows keeps them: a shortcut each in
+ * %APPDATA%\Microsoft\Internet Explorer\Quick Launch\User Pinned\TaskBar
+ * (installers and programs that pin themselves write there too), in the
+ * order HKCU\Software\Stained Glass\Taskbar PinOrder lists their file names
+ * (a REG_MULTI_SZ; shortcuts it does not name follow, by name).
+ *
+ * Copyright 2026 Stained Glass OS
